{
  "description": "The START menu's third page (interface/mod_settings/mod_settings.py). Each name below is a key of menu_texts: the text, in the game's five languages.",
  "line": {"value": {"name": "mod_settings", "help": "mod_settings_help"}, "description": "The first row of the third page and the description shown while the cursor is on it. The page's other rows are the game's \"- - - - -\" line."},
  "entries": {
    "value": [{"name": "menu_graphics", "help": "menu_graphics_help", "opens": {"entries": [{"option": "cheat_3d_mode"}, {"option": "cheat_no_bloom_dof"}, {"option": "cheat_fps"}, {"option": "cheat_fov"}]}}, {"name": "menu_gameplay", "help": "menu_gameplay_help", "opens": {"entries": [{"option": "touchless_target"}, {"option": "hold_a"}, {"option": "fast_text"}, {"option": "fast_gathering"}, {"option": "camera_speed"}]}}, {"name": "menu_other", "help": "menu_other_help", "opens": {"entries": [{"option": "cheat_net_fix"}, {"option": "cheat_raw_unbloat"}, {"option": "box_equipment"}, {"option": "system_keyboard"}, {"option": "skip_death_camera"}]}}, {"name": "aspect_ratio", "help": "aspect_ratio_help", "aspect": true, "opens": {"title": "aspect_ratio", "screen": "aspect_list"}}],
    "description": "The small list that Mod Settings opens, in order, 1 to 10 rows (the game's small list shows 5: a list of more has a second page, and the pager at pager_place says which). A row has its name and its description and what A opens: another small list ({\"entries\": [rows]}, whose B comes back to this row), a screen of the code ({\"title\": a text, \"screen\": aspect_list}), or an option's list of values ({\"option\": key} alone: its name, description and title come from `options`). A row with \"aspect\" is left out unless the aspect ratio's switch is on; an option the player's game cannot have is left out, and so is a list left with no row. All the lists together may have 6 lists and 16 rows (the code's data block)."
  },
  "pager_place": {"value": [310, 22], "description": "Where a list's page number goes (a big list's, and a small list's of two pages, which then stands in for the menu's own), x and y in the top screen's layout: the place the game gives its own big lists."},
  "save_zone": {"value": {"offset": 74976, "magic": "RADL", "version": 1}, "description": "Where a character keeps the mod's choices: 48 bytes at this offset of the save data (0x124E0; the data starts 0x5C into the save object and the file holds its first 0x12600 bytes), which no code of the game reads. A character without the magic has none yet. The aspect ratio is its byte 9, the options' bytes 10 and up (`options`)."},
