    "description": "The lines and descriptions of the menu, in the five languages, appended to each language's Menu file: the game finds a text by its index, the file's message count plus its place here, so a new text goes at the end. {slot} is filled by the code, in a row with the ratio's name. A row holds one line of text; a description (a key ending in _help) up to two, split by a line break as the game's own."
  },
